      "name": "Advanced Major Electives (3-5 Credit Hours)",
      "group_type": "freeform",
      "n_required": null,
      "credit_hours_required": 3,
      "notes_html": "<p data-indent=\"1\"> Students must complete advanced major electives in Computer Science courses numbered 4000 or above as approved by the adviser. CS 4340 may not be used to meet this requirement.</p><p data-indent=\"1\">Note: Students who take CS 5315 to fulfill the Lyle EDGE Leadership and Mentoring requirements are required to take 3 credits of advanced major electives. All other students must take 5 credits of advanced major electives. Students may petition to count up to 6 credit hours of Lyle courses from other departments numbered 4000 or above toward advanced major electives with advisor approval</p>",
